    {
      "bbox": [
        370,
        685,
        1300,
        774
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is the policy of The City of New York to ensure for the women of the City freedom from discrimination based upon sex, to assure for them the benefits of equal opportunity, the full utilization of their talents and, in general, to promote their economic and social well-being; and",
